# Example only. You do not need to copy this: start.ps1 creates the real file on its first run at
#     %USERPROFILE%\.kaggle-coder\.env      (outside the game folder)
# Never put a real key in this example file: it goes to GitHub.
#
# The real file has one line: your own helper key, 32 or more letters and numbers.
# CODER_API_KEY=made-for-you-by-start.ps1
#
# Your Kaggle API token does NOT go here. It goes in %USERPROFILE%\.kaggle\access_token
